        },
        {
          "text": " Maana, sasa je! Ni wanadamu ninaowashawishi, au Mungu? Au nataka kuwapendeza wanadamu? Kama ningekuwa hata sasa nawapendeza wanadamu, singekuwa mtumwa wa Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
